      "statement": "Identify the error in this paragraph:\n\"In the modern world, **well-educated** (A) workers are essential. **Because of** (B) technology is changing so fast, we need to adapt. **Not only do we need** (C) technical skills, but also soft skills. **Seldom have we** (D) seen such a rapid transformation.\"",
